# Day 34 - CSS Selectors and Hero Section

## Learning Objectives

- Learned how CSS selectors work.
- Learned the difference between selectors and properties.
- Built my first Hero Section.

## CSS Syntax

```css
selector{
    property:value;
}
```

## Types of Selectors

### Element Selector

```css
h1{}
```

### Class Selector

```css
.hero{}
```

### ID Selector

```css
#logo{}
```

## Practical Work

- Created a navigation bar.
- Built a Hero Section.
- Added a heading, paragraph, and button.
- Styled the page using CSS.

## Key Takeaways

- Selectors choose HTML elements.
- Properties change how elements look.
- Hero Sections are the first impression of a website.
